-foundation-libgen-li_133", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_137", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_138", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_140", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_141", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_145", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_153", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_156", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_161", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_170", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_171", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_173", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_174", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_175", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_186", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_195", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_197", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_201", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_202", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_203", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_204", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_205", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_206", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_207", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_208", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_209", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_211", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_212", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_215", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_220", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_221", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_222", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_223", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_228", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_230", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_233", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_240", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_243", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_244", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_245", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_249", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_250", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_254", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_256"]}
{"person_name": "Pirenne", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "We are first of all and last of all-scientists. And our concern is the Encyclopedia.", "start": 1085, "end": 1155}, {"text": "The Vault and its opening concern the Board of Trustees alone. Anything of importance will be communicated to the people.", "start": 1445, "end": 1535}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.8, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Lewis Pirenne was busily engaged at his desk in the one well-lit corner of the room. Work had to be co-ordinated. Effort had to be organized.", "start": 451, "end": 561}, {"text": "Pirenne's stylus made the faintest scraping sound as it raced across paper. Otherwise, neither motion nor sound.", "start": 732, "end": 812}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.2, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Pirenne did not look up. Hardin smiled to himself. He was in a hurry, but he knew better than to take offense at Pirenne's cavalier treatment of anything or anyone that disturbed him at his work.", "start": 678, "end": 818}, {"text": "If Hardin found himself bored by the afternoon and evening that followed, he had at least the satisfaction of realizing that Pirenne and Haut Rodric – having met with loud and mutual protestations of esteem and regard – were detesting each other's company a good deal more.", "start": 1985, "end": 2155}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Pirenne sighed and shoved himself away from the desk. \"I'm ready. But I hope you aren't going to bother me with city affairs. Take care of that yourself, please. The Encyclopedia takes up all my time.\"", "start": 872, "end": 1002}, {"text": "Pirenne's lips tightened. He felt annoyed. \"Yes. A special envoy will be sent to us from Anacreon. In two weeks.\" \"An envoy? Here? From Anacreon?\" Pirenne chewed that. \"What for?\"", "start": 1655, "end": 1755}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_47", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_48", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_49", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_50", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_51", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_53", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_54", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_55", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_56", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_57", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_58", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_59", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_60", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_61", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_62", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_63", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_64", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_65", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_66", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_67", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_68", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_70", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_72", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_73", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_74", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_75", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_77", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_80", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_81", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_82", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_88"]}
{"person_name": "Chen", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Chen, throughout the trial, rarely said a word. He made it quite clear that much speech was beneath his dignity.", "start": 1043, "end": 1121}, {"text": "I do not wish to take the trouble to understand mysticism.", "start": 2045, "end": 2095}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Chen said, \"Dr. Seldon, you disturb the peace of the Emperor's realm.\"", "start": 1925, "end": 1980}, {"text": "The opportunity for choosing between death and exile is given you over a time period stretching from this moment to one five minutes hence.", "start": 2480, "end": 2580}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.2, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Chen, throughout the trial, rarely said a word. He made it quite clear that much speech was beneath his dignity.", "start": 1043, "end": 1121}, {"text": "Chen's upper eyelids dropped a little. \"How so?\" he said.", "start": 2180, "end": 2225}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Chen said, \"These are words to frighten children, and yet your death is not the only answer which will satisfy us.\"", "start": 2300, "end": 2380}, {"text": "Negligently, he turned the papers upon his desk with his fingertips so that they faced Seldon.", "start": 2630, "end": 2700}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.2, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Chen, throughout the trial, rarely said a word. He made it quite clear that much speech was beneath his dignity.", "start": 1043, "end": 1121}, {"text": "Chen said, \"These are words to frighten children, and yet your death is not the only answer which will satisfy us.\"", "start": 2300, "end": 2380}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_26", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_32", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_40", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_41", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_42", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_43", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_44", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_45"]}
{"person_name": "Mallow", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Mallow breathed deeply, \"As a spy?\" \"Not at all. As a trader – but with your eyes open.", "start": 1183, "end": 1245}, {"text": "Mallow lounged back in his chair and stared at his thick fingers, \"Uh-uh. Sorry, Twer. I'm leaving next week on business.", "start": 2045, "end": 2118}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Mallow never made the mistake of being overpolite to a Foundation man.", "start": 451, "end": 510}, {"text": "The trader rose, shook hands roughly, and strode out.", "start": 1345, "end": 1385}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "You ran the meeting. You had those red-necked oxen planted in their seats, then put them in your shirtpocket and walked off with them.", "start": 1915, "end": 2000}, {"text": "Mallow's hand fell on the other's balled fist. \"Don't go into a blaze. If it's a trick, I'll be back some day for the reckoning.", "start": 2265, "end": 2340}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_178", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_179", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_180", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_181", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_182", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_185", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_186", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_187", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_188", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_189", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_190", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_191", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_192", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_193", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_194", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_195", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_196", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_197", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_198", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_199", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_200", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_201", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_202", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_203", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_204", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_206", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_207", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_208", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_209", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_210", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_211", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_212", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_213", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_214", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_215", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_216", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_217", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_219", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_220", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_221", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_222", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_223", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_224", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_225", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_226", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_227", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_228", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_229", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_230", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_231", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_232", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_233", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_234", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_235", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_236", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_237", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_238", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_240", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_241", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_242", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_243", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_245", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_246", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_247", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_248", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_249", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_250", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_251", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_252", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_253", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_254", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_255", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_256"]}
{"person_name": "my father", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Despite your opinion, the dinner is to be on the most lavish scale.", "start": 276, "end": 334}, {"text": "And now when you are master of this hinterland, you may be sufficiently respectable to be of some weight and importance in the Empire.", "start": 2043, "end": 2150}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Well, there's no need for threats. You are free to question the man yourself tonight.", "start": 688, "end": 758}, {"text": "And who, my dear, is the excellent source from which your understanding understands all this?", "start": 1530, "end": 1592}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "And haven't you five? Don't deny it. I know you have five; and a sixth is promised.", "start": 1725, "end": 1785}, {"text": "I am growing old. I am weary. I lack the resilience to withstand your rattling mouth.", "start": 1924, "end": 1988}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_205", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_243", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_244"]}
{"person_name": "Grand Master", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "I have lost count of the times you wanderers have been warned that your devil's machines are not wanted anywhere in Askone.", "start": 451, "end": 556}, {"text": "Your goods are worthless in that they lack the ancestral blessing. Your goods are wicked and accursed in that they lie under the ancestral interdict.", "start": 1085, "end": 1190}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Each little sub-secretary required soothing and conciliation. Each required careful and nauseating milking for the flourishing signature that was the pathway to the next official one higher up.", "start": 366, "end": 515}, {"text": "The Askonian's hands spread apart, \"You ask me to trade places with you, and make known to you my wants. I think not. Your colleague, it seems, must suffer the punishment set for sacrilege by the Askonian code.", "start": 1250, "end": 1370}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "\"Don't speak,\" snapped the Grand Master, and Ponyets' opening lips closed tightly. \"That's right,\" the Askonian ruler relaxed visibly, \"I can't endure useless chatter. You cannot threaten and I won't abide flattery. Nor is there room for injured complaints.", "start": 600, "end": 780}, {"text": "The Grand Master said slowly and suspiciously, \"You are a Tender of the Soul?\" Ponyets dropped a humble head, \"I have been so trained.", "start": 1600, "end": 1680}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_157", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_158", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_159", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_160", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_161", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_162", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_164", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_165", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_166", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_167", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_168", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_171", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_172", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_175", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_176", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_177", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_200"]}
{"person_name": "Korell", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Mallow said, quite suddenly, but quite matter-of-factly, \"I tell you what, how about coming with me?\"", "start": 1000, "end": 1060}, {"text": "Mallow repeated, \"Good trading here. You might call this virgin territory.\"", "start": 2000, "end": 2060}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Mallow breathed deeply, \"As a spy?\" \"Not at all. As a trader – but with your eyes open.\"", "start": 1500, "end": 1560}, {"text": "Mallow grasped and shook the other's hand, \"Good! All fired good! And now I've got to round up the boys.\"", "start": 1800, "end": 1860}]}, {"trait_name": "extraversion", "score": 0.5, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "The trader rose, shook hands roughly, and strode out.", "start": 1600, "end": 1650}, {"text": "Mallow said thoughtfully, \"Good trading material here.\" He was staring quietly out the viewport.", "start": 2100, "end": 2160}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_178", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_179", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_180", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_181", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_187", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_188", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_191", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_192", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_193", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_197", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_198", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_206", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_226", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_227", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_229", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_232", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_239", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_240", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_241", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_242", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_243", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_244", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_246", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_248", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_249", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_250", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_251", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_252", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_253", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_254", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_255"]}
{"person_name": "Prince Lefkin", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.3, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Lefkin looked about wildly. \"Seize that man. Arrest him, or by Space, I will send every man within reach of my voice out the air lock in the nude.\"", "start": 1083, "end": 1181}, {"text": "The disheveled Lefkin, bleeding, beaten, and half stunned, did so. \"And now,\" continued Aporat, grimly, \"we are in contact with Anacreon on the hyperwave beam. Speak as I order you.\" Lefkin made a gesture of negation, and the mob in the room and the others crowding the corridor beyond, growled fearfully.", "start": 1445, "end": 1600}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.2, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Lefkin looked about wildly. \"Seize that man. Arrest him, or by Space, I will send every man within reach of my voice out the air lock in the nude.\"", "start": 1083, "end": 1181}, {"text": "The disheveled Lefkin, bleeding, beaten, and half stunned, did so. \"And now,\" continued Aporat, grimly, \"we are in contact with Anacreon on the hyperwave beam. Speak as I order you.\" Lefkin made a gesture of negation, and the mob in the room and the others crowding the corridor beyond, growled fearfully.", "start": 1445, "end": 1600}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.8, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Lefkin looked about wildly. \"Seize that man. Arrest him, or by Space, I will send every man within reach of my voice out the air lock in the nude.\"", "start": 1083, "end": 1181}, {"text": "The disheveled Lefkin, bleeding, beaten, and half stunned, did so. \"And now,\" continued Aporat, grimly, \"we are in contact with Anacreon on the hyperwave beam. Speak as I order you.\" Lefkin made a gesture of negation, and the mob in the room and the others crowding the corridor beyond, growled fearfully.", "start": 1445, "end": 1600}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_141", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_142", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_144", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_145"]}
{"person_name": "my", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.8, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "I opened a book at random and set up free association, beginning with whatever I first saw.", "start": 451, "end": 523}, {"text": "I could take advantage of that and at least mention black holes, for instance.", "start": 2045, "end": 2111}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "I had kept 'Lightning Rod' as my working title all the way through, but Hugh finally said, 'Is there any way of putting 'Foundation' into the title, Isaac?'", "start": 2345, "end": 2460}, {"text": "The novel progressed steadily, and on January 17, 1982, I began final copy.", "start": 2185, "end": 2245}]}, {"trait_name": "agreeableness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "I had no objection to earning a little more money by having the Foundation series reprinted in book form.", "start": 1085, "end": 1155}, {"text": "I said, 'That's way too much money, Betty.' 'No, it isn't,' she said.", "start": 1945, "end": 2000}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_0", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_1", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_2", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_3", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_4", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_5", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_6", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_7", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_8", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_9", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_10", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_12", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_13", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_19", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_21", "foundation-1-asimov-isaac-foundation-libgen-li_23", "foundation-1-asimov-isa